Measured with `git blame` on the current tree: 1,995 lines across 18 tracked files. I used `-w -M -C` and ignored commit `62628c0`.

That commit is the style reformat by "Fiona Formatter". It rewrote 291 lines (indent and quotes) and would otherwise show as the third-largest owner. With it ignored, those lines go back to whoever wrote them.

